  "worked_solution": "Since the sum of the measures of the interior angles of a triangle is ${180}^{∘}$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{40}^{∘}+z+3z & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ {40}^{∘}+4z & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ 4z & ={140}^{∘} \\\\ z & ={35}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
